{"seq":3,"slug":"electricity-markets-and-storage-economics","title":"电力市场与储能经济","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/power-grid-and-energy-storage/flexibility-and-markets/electricity-markets-and-storage-economics","wordCount":2215,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"电力市场与储能经济\">电力市场与储能经济</h1><p>一台并网电池本身不创造价值——它只是把电从「便宜的时刻」搬到「昂贵的时刻」，再顺手把毫秒级的调节能力卖给电网。它能不能赚回成本，几乎完全取决于它接入的是哪个电力市场、那个市场此刻的价格结构，以及调度算法能不能在同一块电芯上把多种收入「叠」起来。2026 年，这门生意正经历一次结构性转折：曾经撑起电池营收大头的调频/辅助服务正在被自己挤垮价格，价值正迅速向能量套利和容量市场迁移。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-收入叠加与市场分型\">核心概念：收入叠加与市场分型</h2><p>储能经济的核心词是「收入叠加」（revenue stacking）：同一套电池在同一时间窗内，按机会成本动态地在多个产品之间切换——能量套利、辅助服务（调频、备用）、容量/资源充裕度。Modo Energy 的测算指出，一套调度良好的能量管理系统，靠把调频、套利、容量这几层叠好，年营收可以比同样硬件但调度拙劣的系统高出 30–40%（<a href=\"https://modoenergy.com/research/en/battery-storage-us-electricity-markets\">Modo Energy</a>）。</p>\n<p>各电力市场的「分型」差异极大，直接决定了收入栈的形状：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>市场</th>\n<th>容量/充裕度机制</th>\n<th>主导收入来源（2026）</th>\n<th>装机规模与特征</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ERCOT（得州）</td>\n<td>无（纯能量市场 energy-only）</td>\n<td>能量套利占比已升至约 76%</td>\n<td>Q1 2026 约 14.96 GW / 24.6 GWh</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CAISO（加州）</td>\n<td>Slice-of-Day 资源充裕度</td>\n<td>套利为主，辅助服务已饱和</td>\n<td>2026 年 5 月 EDAM 上线，打通跨区日前交易</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PJM</td>\n<td>容量市场拍卖</td>\n<td>调频（2025 年 10 月重设计后）</td>\n<td>早 2026 单位营收领跑，约 $62/kW-月</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>英国 GB</td>\n<td>容量市场 + 长时储能 cap-and-floor</td>\n<td>平衡机制 + 批发套利</td>\n<td>辅助服务占比从 2022 年 84% 跌至 2024 年约 20%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>下面这张图描述同一块电池在一天里如何在收入层之间流转。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[电池可用容量&lt;br/&gt;SoC 状态] --&gt; B{机会成本比较&lt;br/&gt;每个时段}&#10;  B --&gt;|价差最大| C[能量套利&lt;br/&gt;低买高卖]&#10;  B --&gt;|频率事件价值高| D[辅助服务&lt;br/&gt;调频/备用]&#10;  B --&gt;|系统紧张时段| E[容量/充裕度&lt;br/&gt;可用性付费]&#10;  C --&gt; F[实时与日前&lt;br/&gt;价格暴露]&#10;  D --&gt; G[毫秒级&lt;br/&gt;功率响应]&#10;  E --&gt; H[长期合约&lt;br/&gt;稳定现金流]&#10;  F --&gt; I[总营收&lt;br/&gt;收入叠加]&#10;  G --&gt; I&#10;  H --&gt; I\">flowchart TD\n  A[电池可用容量&lt;br/&gt;SoC 状态] --&gt; B{机会成本比较&lt;br/&gt;每个时段}\n  B --&gt;|价差最大| C[能量套利&lt;br/&gt;低买高卖]\n  B --&gt;|频率事件价值高| D[辅助服务&lt;br/&gt;调频/备用]\n  B --&gt;|系统紧张时段| E[容量/充裕度&lt;br/&gt;可用性付费]\n  C --&gt; F[实时与日前&lt;br/&gt;价格暴露]\n  D --&gt; G[毫秒级&lt;br/&gt;功率响应]\n  E --&gt; H[长期合约&lt;br/&gt;稳定现金流]\n  F --&gt; I[总营收&lt;br/&gt;收入叠加]\n  G --&gt; I\n  H --&gt; I</pre><h2 id=\"能量套利-从-锦上添花-到-营收主体\">能量套利：从「锦上添花」到「营收主体」</h2><p>套利的逻辑朴素：在价格低谷（常常是中午光伏过剩、甚至负电价）充电，在晚高峰净负荷爬坡时放电。它的可捕获价值由两个量驱动——日内价差的幅度，和电池的能量时长（多数现役项目是 2 小时或 4 小时）。</p>\n<p>加州的「鸭子曲线」把这个机会放到了极致：正午光伏挤压批发价至零甚至负值，傍晚太阳落山而空调负荷未退，价格陡升。但市场在自我消解。在 ERCOT，过去 12 个月里套利占电池营收的比重从约 25% 三倍跃升到约 76%，正是因为辅助服务价格被打穿，运营商被迫转向套利（<a href=\"https://www.energy-storage.news/ercot-after-rtcb-how-real-time-optimisation-is-reshaping-battery-storage-economics/\">Energy-Storage.News</a>）。</p>\n<p>套利收益可以粗略写成对每个调度周期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 的价差求和，再扣除往返效率损失：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>t</mi></munder><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>⋅</mo><mi>η</mi><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msubsup><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msubsup><mi>η</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{arb} = \\sum_{t} \\left( p_t^{dis} \\cdot \\eta - \\frac{p_t^{chg}}{\\eta} \\right) \\cdot q_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.644em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.967em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4542em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2458em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_t^{dis}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0961em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_t^{chg}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2128em;vertical-align:-0.2458em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.967em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4542em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2458em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 分别是放/充电时段的节点边际电价（LMP），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span> 是单程效率（往返效率约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>η</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.85</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta^2 \\approx 0.85</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.85</span></span></span></span></span>），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该周期吞吐电量。注意当充电价为负时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_t^{chg} &lt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2128em;vertical-align:-0.2458em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.967em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4542em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2458em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>，这一项反而变成收入——电网付钱让电池吸纳过剩电力。</p>\n<p>ERCOT 在 RTC+B（实时联合优化与备用）改革后，套利的「基准」已经变成：能否在实时市场抓住负价或近零价充电、抓住价格尖峰放电，同时锁定日前价差（<a href=\"https://modoenergy.com/research/en/ercot-caiso-june-2025-revenue-stack-batteries-bess-energy-arbitrage-nodal-price-locational-marginal-price-transmission-congestion-price-spreads\">Modo Energy</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"辅助服务的饱和-先发者的红利正在蒸发\">辅助服务的饱和：先发者的红利正在蒸发</h2><p>辅助服务曾是电池最甜的入口——响应快、单价高、几乎专为储能而设。但它的市场容量很小，电池一拥而入就把价格踩塌。</p>\n<p>英国是最戏剧性的样本：动态遏制（Dynamic Containment）2022 年平均收益超过 £20/MWh、峰值近 £80/MWh，到 2024 年 2 月已跌破 £0.50/MWh（<a href=\"https://www.spglobal.com/energy/en/news-research/latest-news/electric-power/012121-uks-national-grid-to-allow-game-changing-revenue-stacking-in-balancing-mechanism\">S&amp;P Global</a>）。整体上辅助服务在英国电池营收中的占比从 2022 年的 84% 暴跌到 2024 年的约 20%。加州同样如此：2025 年 4 月到 11 月间，CAISO 的下调频价格下跌近 50%，上调频跌幅超过 60%（<a href=\"https://www.energy-storage.news/where-is-alpha-market-trends-in-ercot-and-caiso-impacting-battery-storage-revenues/\">Energy-Storage.News</a>）。</p>\n<p>这条规律对投资人是硬约束：辅助服务是「先到先得」的浅水池，越晚进场分到的越少。2026 年还在把整个商业计划压在辅助服务上的项目，基本被视为高风险。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[早期阶段&lt;br/&gt;少量电池] --&gt; B[辅助服务高价&lt;br/&gt;占营收主体]&#10;  B --&gt; C[更多电池涌入&lt;br/&gt;抢同一浅水池]&#10;  C --&gt; D[价格被踩塌&lt;br/&gt;单位收益骤降]&#10;  D --&gt; E[价值迁移&lt;br/&gt;转向套利与容量]&#10;  E --&gt; F[新进入者&lt;br/&gt;已无辅助服务红利]\">graph TD\n  A[早期阶段&lt;br/&gt;少量电池] --&gt; B[辅助服务高价&lt;br/&gt;占营收主体]\n  B --&gt; C[更多电池涌入&lt;br/&gt;抢同一浅水池]\n  C --&gt; D[价格被踩塌&lt;br/&gt;单位收益骤降]\n  D --&gt; E[价值迁移&lt;br/&gt;转向套利与容量]\n  E --&gt; F[新进入者&lt;br/&gt;已无辅助服务红利]</pre><h2 id=\"容量市场与可用性付费-换取确定性\">容量市场与可用性付费：换取确定性</h2><p>与套利、辅助服务的「即时博弈」不同，容量机制付的是「在系统最紧张时你能放电」这件事本身的可用性，与你那一刻是否真的放电无关。它牺牲了套利的上行空间，换来可融资的稳定现金流。</p>\n<p>PJM 是典型：经过 2025 年 10 月调频产品重设计后，PJM 在早 2026 的单位营收领跑全美，约 $62/kW-月，且容量拍卖收入是栈中重要一层（<a href=\"https://modoenergy.com/research/en/battery-storage-us-electricity-markets\">Modo Energy</a>）。加州正在用 Slice-of-Day 资源充裕度改革重塑容量认定方式——按一天中各时段分别考核可用性，这对短时电池的容量信用是直接约束。英国则为长时储能（LDES）引入了 cap-and-floor 机制：设定收益下限以吸引私人资本，同时保留上行空间（<a href=\"https://www.latitudemedia.com/news/the-uks-battery-market-can-boom-again/\">Latitude Media</a>）。</p>\n<p>更进一步，2026 年的对冲主流是「实物代运营协议」（physical tolling）：受让方（offtaker）获得电池的物理调度权，自己竞价、调度，业主则不论实际使用如何都收一笔固定/结构化费用。某 2026 储能大会上 75% 的与会者表示在考虑实物 toll；典型结构是先跑 12 个月纯商业（merchant），再转入约 80% toll、为期 5–7 年（<a href=\"https://www.ess-news.com/2026/03/31/bbdf-2026-finance-tolling-and-getting-the-merchant-balance-right/\">ess-news</a>）。这把电芯吞吐量和市场价格的不确定性，从业主转移给了更能消化波动的交易对手。</p>\n<h2 id=\"经济性底座-lcos-循环老化与替换成本\">经济性底座：LCOS、循环老化与替换成本</h2><p>把市场收入放一边，电池本身的成本结构决定了它能不能赚钱。衡量基准是平准化储能成本（LCOS）：把全生命周期总成本（CAPEX + O&amp;M + 充电成本 + 退化）除以折现后的累计放电量。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>t</mi></munder><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&amp;</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>t</mi></munder><mfrac><msubsup><mi>E</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>t</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">LCOS = \\frac{C_{capex} + \\sum_t \\frac{C_t^{O\\&amp;M} + C_t^{chg}}{(1+r)^t}}{\\sum_t \\frac{E_t^{dis}}{(1+r)^t}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.6211em;vertical-align:-1.512em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.1092em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2072em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.1992em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1308em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.102em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\"><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7253em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.5134em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8408em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2095em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8448em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2905em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.52em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4292em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.1992em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.1092em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.1992em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1308em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1992em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\"><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7253em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.5134em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.927em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.214em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.931em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">&amp;</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.286em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9797em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2095em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.9837em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2905em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.52em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.512em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>2026 年的成本现状：一套典型 500 kW / 1000 kWh 的工商业系统，全装机成本约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>350</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>450</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>W</mi><mi>h</mi><mtext>；磷酸铁锂（</mtext><mi>L</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>P</mi><mtext>）工商业系统的</mtext><mi>L</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>S</mi><mtext>约</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">350–450/kWh；磷酸铁锂（LFP）工商业系统的 LCOS 约</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">350–450/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">；磷酸铁锂（</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">）工商业系统的</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">约</span></span></span></span></span>0.12–0.18/kWh，对比零售峰价（常 &gt; <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>W</mi><mi>h</mi><mtext>）和需量电费（</mtext><mo>&gt;</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.25/kWh）和需量电费（&gt;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.25/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">）和需量电费（</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span></span></span></span></span>15/kW）有明显优势（<a href=\"https://www.foxtheon.com/news/industry-news/cost-of-battery-energy-storage-system-full-breakdown-2026/\">Foxtheon</a>、<a href=\"https://www.highjoule.com/blog/understanding-bess-lcos-a-comprehensive-guide.html\">Highjoule</a>）。</p>\n<p>但 LCOS 不是常数，因为电池在老化。LFP 电芯每年损失约 0.5–1.5% 容量（取决于温度和放电深度），10 年后有效可用容量约降到初始额定的 85% 左右。这意味着同一套调度策略，套利和削峰收入会逐年缩水。循环 6000–8000 次（约 12–15 年）后模组可能需要更换，预计 2036 年替换成本约 $120–150/kWh（<a href=\"https://www.foxtheon.com/news/industry-news/cost-of-battery-energy-storage-system-full-breakdown-2026/\">Foxtheon</a>）。</p>\n<p>这就是为什么严谨的调度优化必须把「退化」当成边际成本计入：每多放一度电，既赚了当下的价差，也消耗了一点点未来的容量寿命。调度算法的目标函数因此是带退化惩罚项的净收益最大化：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>t</mi></munder><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max \\; R_{arb} + R_{AS} + R_{cap} - \\sum_t c_{deg}(d_t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{deg}(d_t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是该周期放电深度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 对应的边际退化成本。把它设为零，算法会过度循环、提前榨干电池；设得过高，则会错过本该抓住的价差。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>储能不靠单一收入活着，靠「收入叠加」：同一块电池在套利、辅助服务、容量之间按机会成本动态切换，叠好与叠不好的年营收差 30–40%。</li>\n<li>市场分型决定收入栈形状：ERCOT 纯能量市场逼出套利主导（占比约 76%）、PJM 靠容量+调频领跑（约 $62/kW-月）、英国走 cap-and-floor 稳住长时储能。</li>\n<li>辅助服务是浅水池，先到先得：英国占比从 84% 跌到 20%，CAISO 调频价半年腰斩——2026 年押注辅助服务即高风险。</li>\n<li>价值正迁向套利与容量；套利收益由日内价差与能量时长驱动，负电价时充电反而是收入。</li>\n<li>经济性底座是 LCOS（LFP 工商业约 $0.12–0.18/kWh）与退化（年损 0.5–1.5%、10 年降至 85%）；调度优化必须把退化当边际成本，否则要么过度循环、要么错失价差。</li>\n<li>对冲手段从纯商业转向实物 tolling（典型 12 个月 merchant 后转 80% toll、5–7 年），把价格波动从业主转给交易对手。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"电力市场与储能经济","id":"电力市场与储能经济"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：收入叠加与市场分型","id":"核心概念-收入叠加与市场分型"},{"level":2,"text":"能量套利：从「锦上添花」到「营收主体」","id":"能量套利-从-锦上添花-到-营收主体"},{"level":2,"text":"辅助服务的饱和：先发者的红利正在蒸发","id":"辅助服务的饱和-先发者的红利正在蒸发"},{"level":2,"text":"容量市场与可用性付费：换取确定性","id":"容量市场与可用性付费-换取确定性"},{"level":2,"text":"经济性底座：LCOS、循环老化与替换成本","id":"经济性底座-lcos-循环老化与替换成本"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"虚拟电厂","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/power-grid-and-energy-storage/flexibility-and-markets/virtual-power-plants"},"next":null}